in the context of COVID,

00:16:53.310 --> 00:16:57.090
we got funding from outside
foundation for that,

00:16:57.090 --> 00:16:59.880
and we're also gonna be
hosting a touring performance

00:16:59.880 --> 00:17:02.050
of Ezelle in the spring.

00:17:02.050 --> 00:17:04.360
So let me stop there

00:17:04.360 --> 00:17:06.710
and just say, please if
they're interests contact me,

00:17:06.710 --> 00:17:09.470
I would love to work very
much at the early stages

00:17:09.470 --> 00:17:10.970
of developing something

00:17:10.970 --> 00:17:13.010
and all ideas

00:17:13.010 --> 00:17:14.863
and energy is welcome.

00:17:16.056 --> 00:17:19.223
(audience applauding)

