00:18:11.030 --> 00:18:13.300
What are some of the
challenges around this issue?

00:18:13.300 --> 00:18:16.820
So we would definitely go
out to thought leaders,

00:18:16.820 --> 00:18:20.860
individuals who are in
environment situations much,

00:18:20.860 --> 00:18:21.693
like I think,

00:18:21.693 --> 00:18:23.760
you know, yours was a perfect example.

00:18:23.760 --> 00:18:25.390
And part of what we've been talking

00:18:25.390 --> 00:18:28.170
