00:19:31.060 --> 00:19:32.570
And in our experience,

00:19:32.570 --> 00:19:35.100
we've worked with so
many community partners

00:19:35.100 --> 00:19:36.610
with grassroots in arts initiatives

00:19:36.610 --> 00:19:37.493
