00:19:58.180 --> 00:20:00.070
So it's arts and resource development,

00:20:00.070 --> 00:20:01.380
art and health

00:20:01.380 --> 00:20:04.090
art and economic development,

00:20:04.090 --> 00:20:05.100
for instance.

00:20:05.100 --> 00:20:08.013
So how do you anticipate,

00:20:10.420 --> 00:20:12.280
do you anticipate that your,

00:20:12.280 --> 00:20:17.180
your findings in your research
will provide some tools

00:20:17.180 --> 00:20:20.460
for organizations to be
able to seek more stable

00:20:20.460 --> 00:20:23.630
and sustainable support
review and conversely,

00:20:23.630 --> 00:20:28.630
how do you anticipate the
challenge of this exacerbating

00:20:28.660 --> 00:20:32.370
that part of your challenge?

00:20:32.370 --> 00:20:33.203
And then finally,

00:20:33.203 --> 00:20:34.036
as part of that,

00:20:35.700 --> 00:20:39.700
how do you consider kind
of the cultural equity of

00:20:39.700 --> 00:20:41.160
a challenge of whose art

00:20:42.810 --> 00:20:44.200
(mumbling)

00:20:44.200 --> 00:20:46.210
- Sure, now those are great questions.

00:20:46.210 --> 00:20:48.634
And I think those are very much issues

00:20:48.634 --> 00:20:51.140
that we are processing.

00:20:51.140 --> 00:20:53.480
I feel very fortunate that Taiga Christie,

00:20:53.480 --> 00:20:55.110
who is an integral member

00:20:55.110 --> 00:20:58.140
of our team raises our awareness very much

00:20:58.140 --> 00:21:00.120
about these issues.

00:21:00.120 --> 00:21:02.970
We are bringing artists into the class

00:21:02.970 --> 00:21:03.803
and making sure

00:21:03.803 --> 00:21:06.070
that all artists are
compensated appropriately so

00:21:06.070 --> 00:21:08.059
that we also realize often in art,

00:21:08.059 --> 00:21:11.570
it's almost as if it's supposed
to be a volunteer activity

00:21:11.570 --> 00:21:12.403
or something,

00:21:12.403 --> 00:21:14.631
which we are very cognizant it's,

00:21:14.631 --> 00:21:16.950
as someone who's married to a violinist,

00:21:16.950 --> 00:21:20.180
I very much appreciate
the sphere of the artists.

00:21:20.180 --> 00:21:21.870
I think your question

00:21:21.870 --> 00:21:23.940
about dissemination and sharing,

00:21:23.940 --> 00:21:26.690
and also sustainability
are very much issues

00:21:26.690 --> 00:21:28.520
