00:21:28.520 --> 00:21:30.380
I think, as I mentioned in response,

00:21:30.380 --> 00:21:35.200
the idea of the toolkit is to
make some of these insights

00:21:36.090 --> 00:21:38.979
and thoughts and
impressions from individuals

00:21:38.979 --> 00:21:42.450
and perspectives around
public health issues available

00:21:42.450 --> 00:21:43.283
to artists.

00:21:43.283 --> 00:21:44.116
So the idea is

