that we would like to provide information

00:21:47.230 --> 00:21:49.960
that could help them build their art.

00:21:49.960 --> 00:21:51.400
Support their art.

00:21:51.400 --> 00:21:53.830
I think ultimately for us as a center,

00:21:53.830 --> 00:21:57.380
I very much wanna think
about opportunities

00:21:57.380 --> 00:21:59.650
and resources to support
development of art

00:21:59.650 --> 00:22:00.950
