00:22:10.430 --> 00:22:14.440
So I think that for us a goal would be

00:22:14.440 --> 00:22:17.410
to provide resources as well.

00:22:17.410 --> 00:22:18.870
I think what is exciting

00:22:18.870 --> 00:22:19.970
